\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L19\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"hidden\\\":true,\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L1a\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$15\\\",null,{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Next.Metadata\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$L1b\\\"}]}]}],null]}]\\n12:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0_novvjei_gxi.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1c:Tbb7,\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What are the most popular Addax names?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Popular Addax names include classic choices widely loved by pet owners and enthusiasts. For male Addaxs 🦌, names like Max, Charlie, and Buddy are timeless favorites. For female Addaxs 🦌, Bella, Luna, and Daisy tend to top the charts. Browse our full collection above to find even more options tailored to your preferences.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How do I choose the best name for my Addax?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Choosing the perfect name for your Addax 🦌 depends on their personality, appearance, and your personal taste! Observe your Addax's unique behaviors — are they playful or calm? Bold or shy? Pick a name that feels right when you say it aloud. Short, 1-2 syllable names often work best as they are easier for animals to recognize and respond to.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I use human names for my Addax?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Absolutely! Human names are very popular for Addaxs 🦌. Names like Oliver, Sophie, Jack, or Emma work wonderfully and add a personal, meaningful touch. Many pet owners prefer human names because they create a stronger emotional connection and feel more like a family member than just a pet.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What are some unique Addax names?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"For unique Addax names 🦌, consider fantasy-inspired options, names from foreign languages, or creative invented combinations. Our Fantasy Names and Unique Names categories feature one-of-a-kind options drawn from mythology, literature, and pure imagination. You can also draw inspiration from your favorite books, movies, or video games!\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Should my Addax's name be easy to pronounce?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes! Choose a name that is easy for you and your family to say consistently 🦌. Avoid names that sound too similar to common commands (like \\\\\\\"Kit\\\\\\\" for \\\\\\\"Sit\\\\\\\"). A clear, distinct name helps your Addax recognize when you are calling them and strengthens training effectiveness.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What makes a good name for a Addax?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"A good Addax name is clear, easy to pronounce, and fits your pet's personality. Avoid names that sound like commands or household names. The best names often come from observing your Addax's habits and character — the right name will feel natural after a few days of use.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I give my Addax a humorous or unusual name?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Absolutely — humorous and unusual names often become beloved conversation starters. The key is ensuring the name brings you joy rather than embarrassment when called in public. If you smile every time you say it, it's the right name regardless of convention.\\\"}}]}\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"13:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"All Animals\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/animals/\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":3,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Addax Names\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/animal/addax/\\\\\\\"}]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$1c\\\"}}],\\\"$L1d\\\",\\\"$L1e\\\",\\\"$L1f\\\",\\\"$L20\\\",\\\"$L21\\\",\\\"$L22\\\",\\\"$L23\\\",\\\"$L24\\\",\\\"$L25\\\",\\\"$L26\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"27:I[46183,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/17xyf-6vvra42.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n1d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"nav\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-500 flex gap-1 flex-wrap\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Breadcrumb\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"hover:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Home\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"/\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animals/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"hover:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"All Animals\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"/\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",nu